      "updated": 1791544298374,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Local cache: \n{\n    UserID + isPaid\n}\nlocal counter to locally update reqs \nper user (using atomic data str. to \nprevent race)\n\ntoken bucket algorithm is best due to\nits handling of spikes & gives uniformity\nin that period for requests, no need for \nresets and edge bursts",
      "fontSize": 18.785661256926474,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
